WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:04.160
I’m ranking EVERY FIRE USER IN ANIME from&nbsp;
~~~~crazy fire-breathing girlfriends like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:09.080
this to characters with such powerful&nbsp;
fire that they might as well be gods.

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:13.360
And in a bit of a twist right out of the gate, I’m&nbsp;
going to put the captain commander Yamamoto from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:19.120
Bleach in the God Tier right away because&nbsp;
he is one of the absolute strongest fire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:24.480
user in all of anime. I mean his fire is&nbsp;
literally as hot as the core of the sun,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:29.680
which is pretty god-like if you ask me. But to&nbsp;
keep the surprises coming, I’m actually going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:35.720
to show you exactly how many characters are as&nbsp;
strong or maybe even stronger than Yamamoto in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:42.360
the God Tier. Including him, there are ten of&nbsp;
these absolute fire wielding powerhouses who I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:48.000
think are clearly above every other fire user&nbsp;
in all of anime. Now who are these characters?

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.120
Well, they are all extraordinary fire users,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:55.320
but first let’s shift down from the&nbsp;
God tier to the next strongest tier,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.320 --> 00:01:00.480
which is the Dust Tier. Now I'll admit this is&nbsp;
s bit of a strange name, but basically, to be in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:06.360
this tier your flames have to be SO INCREDIBLY&nbsp;
STRONG that they can literally turn an enemy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:12.080
into a pile of ash. And what better character to&nbsp;
start this tier than Genos from One Punch Man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:18.640
whose incineration Cannons can literally&nbsp;
obliterate opponents and leave nothing behind.

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:24.000
Now we might as well continue introducing the&nbsp;
tiers, so next up is the Generic Overpowered&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:29.360
Anime Fire Users tier. Whew, that's a mouthful.&nbsp;
Maybe I should have just called it the Generic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:34.080
Tier after all. And starting off this tier&nbsp;
we have Magna Swing from Black Clover,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:39.760
who like most of the characters in this tier&nbsp;
can basically summon fire and toss it around to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:46.360
attack his opponents. Not the most powerful, but&nbsp;
still decently strong enough for his own story.

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:53.080
But Magna Swing might as well be a god compared&nbsp;
to this next tier, which is the Poooffff Tier.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:57.997
And essentially these are fairly weak fire users,&nbsp;
at least compared to the rest of the characters&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.997 --> 00:02:02.920
in this video. To start it off we are going to&nbsp;
go way back in the history of anime to Sailor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:10.240
Moon. And this truly was one of the OG shows,&nbsp;
at least outside of Japan, and Sailor Mars is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:16.360
the fire using princess, buuuutttt if I'm being&nbsp;
honest she’s pretty weak. I mean her strongest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:22.400
attack is Flame Sniper, but even this move isn’t&nbsp;
powerful enough to take out a strong opponent.

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:27.560
Which is crazy that Sailor Mars&nbsp;
is even above this final tier,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:32.160
which I’ll call the ‘Barely-Counts-as&nbsp;
A-Fire-User’ Tier. And the perfect example&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:38.200
of this is Bols from Akame Ga Kill. So while&nbsp;
Bols is surprisingly a pretty nice person,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:43.860
he has done some truly horrible things such&nbsp;
as incinerating entire villages with his super&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:50.440
powered flamethrower. But since he can’t actually&nbsp;
make fire himself, he falls into this bottom tier.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:55.120
Which brings us to what might be the most&nbsp;
controversial ranking in this entire video.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.120 --> 00:03:01.640
That’s because we are going to put Madara from&nbsp;
Naruto riiiiggghhht… her. Now before every single&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:06.600
Madara fan types angrily in the comments below,&nbsp;
one thing to keep in mind is that I am ranking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:12.640
these characters most based on their fire powers,&nbsp;
not necessarily all of a character’s overpowered&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:19.720
abilities. And while Madara is certainly a&nbsp;
God Tier fighter, his strongest fire attack,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:24.680
Ultimate Fire Release, is a wide ranging attack&nbsp;
that ultimately was able to be fairly easily&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:31.160
blocked by many ninjas, so that drops him down&nbsp;
from God to Dust Tier, at least as a fire user.

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:35.680
But while the master ninja can burst out&nbsp;
in flames, this next character is a literal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:41.560
fire breathing monster. Of course I’m talking&nbsp;
about Charizard from Pokemon whose Mega X and Y&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:47.000
transformations make him one of the more powerful&nbsp;
mons in all of Pokemon. Plus, he’s just a personal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:50.960
favorite of mine, so don’t complain that these&nbsp;
transformations aren’t in the anime. This is my&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:58.000
tier list. I can do what I want. Bam. Dust Tier.&nbsp;
Even though they did make him into a fluffy toy.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:07.400
Do you know who also needs a hug? This guy&nbsp;
right here, Escanor from the Seven Deadly Sins,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:12.440
who is also the second of our God&nbsp;
Tiers. Because during the night he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:17.520
becomes a whiny weakling who could sure&nbsp;
use some support, but during high noon,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:25.760
oh boy. This man becomes the literal Sun God,&nbsp;
whose blazing sun powers can make even the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:32.000
Demon King look like some kind of slime-tier&nbsp;
character. Mr. The One is God Tier for sure.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:37.240
But even he would run like crazy&nbsp;
from Kyoko Kirisaki from Black Cat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:44.360
who is so crazy she is going to invent&nbsp;
a brand new tier. This is the Crazy Fire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:49.160
Breathing Girlfriend tier. And Kirisaki definitely&nbsp;
deserves to be here because she prefers to defeat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:57.280
her opponents by kissing them and then burning&nbsp;
them from the inside. Yeesh. Swipe Left for me.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:59.440
And while Kirisaki might freak you out,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:05.440
at least she can’t literally burn your soul&nbsp;
like Rei Ogami from Code Breaker. In fact,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:10.560
his flames are so strong that turning someone&nbsp;
to ash is easy, and his most powerful attack&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:16.040
can burn an enemy's soul so that they can&nbsp;
never commit another crime in their entire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:22.080
life. Which earns a place in Dust Tier, and my&nbsp;
vote for him to become police chief for sure.

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:27.920
Which might make this next ranking a bit&nbsp;
controversial, because Hiei from Yuyu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:33.360
Hakusho uses his Dark Flames to become&nbsp;
our next God-Tier level fire user. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:38.240
you may not know that these evil looking&nbsp;
flames can destroy anything in their path,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:44.720
including people and buildings. And while that&nbsp;
is similar to Ogami who we just put in Dust Tier,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:51.920
to me Hiei's flames are just on such another level&nbsp;
altogether that I have to rank him in God Tier.

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:57.240
But that’s three God Tier fire characters&nbsp;
already and we still have seven left to go,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.240 --> 00:06:02.600
plus a ton of other characters. Have&nbsp;
we ranked your favorite fire user yet?

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:07.680
So let’s knock out some of the lower tier&nbsp;
characters. First is Bakugo from My Hero&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:11.640
Academia. And while his explosions&nbsp;
are pretty powerful, they only earn&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:16.360
him a place in the Generic tier because as&nbsp;
usual, he gets the side-character treatment.

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:22.160
And I hate to say it, but I’m also going to&nbsp;
put his classmate Shoto Todoroki in this tier&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:28.120
as well. Which I think is pretty fair, because&nbsp;
I mean he can only truly unlock his strongest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:32.920
fire if he balances it with his ice powers.&nbsp;
Plus as we’ve seen recently in the manga,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:38.760
he couldn’t even 100% take out another of the fire&nbsp;
users that we will see later on in the ranking.

00:06:40.280 --> 00:06:46.040
Now to ruffle even more feathers, let’s discuss&nbsp;
Ace and Sabo from One Piece. Because they both&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:51.280
have the same fire devil fruit powers, but&nbsp;
I’m going to rank one higher than the other.

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:56.320
Let’s start with Ace who unlike other&nbsp;
characters on this list is literally made&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.320 --> 00:07:01.360
of fire. That means normal attacks just&nbsp;
pass right through him and he can summon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:05.800
huge amounts of fire to create super&nbsp;
powerful attacks. So because of this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:11.280
and maybe a little bit of personal bias,&nbsp;
I’m going to put him in… Dust Tier. Yeah,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:17.480
did you think I was going for God Tier? No, even&nbsp;
I have to be somewhat honest in these rankings.

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:25.280
But that leaves us with Sabo. And the big&nbsp;
question is does he go above OR below Ace? Well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:30.600
in my opinion, reusing the same powers&nbsp;
as Ace is not as impressive to me,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:34.560
so even though Sabo is arguably stronger&nbsp;
because of his other fighting abilities,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:38.280
I’m going to rank him down&nbsp;
in the Generic tier for now.

00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:42.880
Now I’ll be honest, this next character was&nbsp;
going to be right beside Sabo in Generic Tier,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:47.200
and that’s because Phoenix Ikki’s&nbsp;
powers are pretty standard. Fiery&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:53.160
blasts. Fire Punches. We know the deal.&nbsp;
But then I remembered two things. First,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:59.640
this anime came out over thirty-five years ago,&nbsp;
which is before I was even born. Which means that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:04.160
we have to ask ourselves if we can really&nbsp;
call these powers generic if Ikki was one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:10.400
of the first mainstream characters to use them.&nbsp;
Plus, because he has the powers of the Phoenix,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:16.120
every time he dies he comes back to life even&nbsp;
stronger. So good luck ever killing him. and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:22.000
all this means I have no other choice but to&nbsp;
make him our fourth God Tier level character.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:28.560
Now Nezuko from Demon Slayer is another character&nbsp;
I went back and forth about. On one hand,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:33.040
her blood based fire powers have honestly&nbsp;
never really defeated anyone on their own.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:37.880
They are more support powers to help her&nbsp;
brother. Plus they only affect demons,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:43.840
so at first I was thinking of the Poof Tier,&nbsp;
but because her powers are pretty unique and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:49.480
can deal some serious damage to even strong&nbsp;
demons, I bumped her up to the Generic Tier.

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:52.760
Now this next character showing up on&nbsp;
this tier list might shock you a bit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:57.480
and that’s because Levy from Black Lagoon&nbsp;
isn’t really a fire user. She actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.480 --> 00:09:03.960
just uses guns and explosives - very well, I&nbsp;
might add - buuuttt, this is a fire tier list,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:07.320
and there’s more than one kind of&nbsp;
fire, if you know what I mean. So&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:13.040
we’ll make her own special tier called the&nbsp;
Technically Not Fire But Still Fire tier.

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:16.560
And another character whose fire you&nbsp;
definitely don’t want to mess with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:20.080
is my super powered kitty, Gojo,&nbsp;
whose fire blasts will surely take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:24.280
over the world unless you stop him by&nbsp;
pressing that big red subscribe button.

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:29.200
Next in the Dust tier is possibly the&nbsp;
most popular character on this list,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:34.320
Roy Mustang. The Flame Alchemist has an&nbsp;
unbelievable knowledge of fire alchemy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:40.480
so much so that with a single snap of his fingers,&nbsp;
he can create super accurate and destructive fire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:46.520
blasts. The only thing actually holding him back&nbsp;
from God Tier is that his powers are harder to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:50.880
use in the rain, although technically he can&nbsp;
separate the water molecules and light the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:56.040
oxygen on fire by using a complex reaction&nbsp;
using… *continue mumbling scientifically*

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:58.280
Oh, right. Sorry. Back to the tier list.

00:09:58.280 --> 00:10:03.600
While Mustang is a fire genius, Ayano&nbsp;
Kannagi from Kaze no Stigma can barely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:08.400
control her magical Crimson Flame,&nbsp;
which lands her in the Poof Tier.

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:12.200
Now if you are an avid anime watcher, you&nbsp;
might have noticed there are characters from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:19.240
one particular anime that we haven’t ranked&nbsp;
yet. Of course, I'm talking about Fire Force,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.240 --> 00:10:24.240
which is a show literally all about fire and&nbsp;
we could probably put almost every character&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:28.560
in Fire Force on this list. But that would&nbsp;
take way too long, so instead we are going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:34.480
to name just a few of them. And what better way&nbsp;
to start than with our fifth God Tier character,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:41.080
Leonard Burns. Seriously, this man’s power&nbsp;
levels can get off the charts. His ability&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:45.640
is called Voltage Nova, which basically&nbsp;
lets him continuously heat up his body,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:51.280
giving him a huge buff in physical strength and&nbsp;
durability the longer it stays active. He brushes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:57.080
off explosions with ease and can literally&nbsp;
melt fireproof clothing just by walking by.

00:10:57.080 --> 00:11:02.040
But now there are only five God Tiers&nbsp;
left. Do you think you know who they are?

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:08.080
But even Burns’ doesn’t get as crazy as&nbsp;
these next three characters. That’s because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:12.920
I’m dropping ANOTHER special tier called&nbsp;
the Pyromaniacs for those fire users who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:17.520
are just a bit messed up in the head. And I&nbsp;
just had to keep them together in the script,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:21.160
because leaving them alone could lead&nbsp;
to them setting the whole thing on fire.

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:26.520
The first is the fire/lightning&nbsp;
princess Azula from Avatar,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:30.680
who shoots off lightning blasts&nbsp;
like a kid at a carnival game.

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:33.440
Right next to her is Dabi from My Hero Academia,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:39.280
who has burned himself so much that he had to&nbsp;
replace his own skin. He is completely unhinged,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:43.520
which you would especially know if you’ve&nbsp;
read the recent events in the manga.

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:49.800
And the final member of this Pyromaniacs tier&nbsp;
is Miyagawa from Mob Psycho, who has pretty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:56.200
standard fire powers but is just an evil dude&nbsp;
who likes to watch his enemies burn to a crisp.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:12:02.320
Luckily for us, the person who defeated Miyagawa&nbsp;
is up next, and that is Teruki Hanazawa,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:07.400
also from Mob Psycho. However, Teru is a&nbsp;
man of many talents and for him, fire is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:13.240
basically a side hustle since he can also use a&nbsp;
ton of other psychic abilities like forcefields,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:17.600
explosions, air whips, and more, but if&nbsp;
we’re talking about just his fire powers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:21.120
he is pretty average, so he’s&nbsp;
going in the Generic Tier.

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:24.680
For example, Teruki would stand no&nbsp;
chance against this next character,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:29.720
and that’s because Gabimaru from Hell’s Paradise&nbsp;
is an explosive flame-erupting ninja who can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:35.240
burn his enemies to a crisp. And while you&nbsp;
might say his powers aren’t anything special,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:40.560
I just love the fact that his powers are so&nbsp;
OP that when he is close to dying he unlocks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:47.760
a fiery berserk mode that can even damage&nbsp;
gods. Definitely deserving of Dust Tier.

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:54.840
This next character takes that to an even higher&nbsp;
level. Unveiling the sixth God tier fire user,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:54.840 --> 00:13:00.320
we have Feitan from Hunter x Hunter. Because&nbsp;
even though he isn’t a pure fire user,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:05.520
his ultimate attack turns all of the damage&nbsp;
he has taken into a blistering rising sun&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:12.720
that literally destroyed an entire fortress. And&nbsp;
that by itself deserves God Tier in my opinion.

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:18.320
However, one character you didn’t quite&nbsp;
make God Tier was Alibaba from Magi, whose&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:23.600
impressive-looking Flame Minister’s Beheading&nbsp;
Sword is pretty remarkable and can easily take&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:29.720
out weaker enemies, but just didn’t do enough&nbsp;
for me to put him any higher than Dust Tier.

00:13:29.720 --> 00:13:34.600
The same can be said for Jogo from Jujutsu&nbsp;
Kaisen, who has some pretty incredible feats.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:34.600 --> 00:13:39.440
He can create a volcanic dimension and&nbsp;
his strongest attack from the manga can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:44.160
bring down a massive flaming meteor that&nbsp;
can destroy an entire city block. Which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:49.480
might have earned him God Tier except for&nbsp;
what happened against this next character.

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:53.840
And a brief manga spoiler warning here, but&nbsp;
when Jogo fought Sukuna the Cursed spirit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:53.840 --> 00:14:01.200
was defeated by this. Which I mean, what is&nbsp;
this? Sukuna’s not supposed to be able to use&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:07.520
fire! So where the heck do we rank this guy?&nbsp;
God Tier? Barely counts tier? I don’t know,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:13.920
so let’s just make his own We Don’t Know WTF&nbsp;
This Is Tier. I’m allowed to do that, right?

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:19.600
Now, we’ve been dealing with some intense flames&nbsp;
for quite a while, so let’s simmer down a bit with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:25.160
Hellfire Flame from One Punch Man in the Poof&nbsp;
Tier. This sword-wielding monster can kick and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:29.760
slash with flames, so if you’re into fiery&nbsp;
swordsmen you might want to check him out.

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:34.440
And below him is Hao Asakura from Shaman King.&nbsp;
And even though Asakura is basically the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:39.360
powerful character in the whole show, he&nbsp;
is only so powerful because he fights by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:45.480
summoning elemental spirits to fight for him&nbsp;
which is why he is in the Barely Counts tier.

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:49.120
But no one can say that this next&nbsp;
character doesn't fight on his own,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:54.520
and his fire powers are like no one&nbsp;
else’s on this list. This is Shishio&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:54.520 --> 00:15:00.280
Makoto from the legendary samurai anime Rurouni&nbsp;
Kenshin. This dude is an incredible swordsman,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:05.760
but his flame powers actually come from a pretty&nbsp;
horrifying source. You see, Makoto soaked his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:11.280
sword in the oily fat of countless opponents so&nbsp;
that now his sword can catch on fire whenever&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:15.800
he wants. That's pretty awful if you ask me,&nbsp;
but still cool to watch him duel with Kenshin.

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:20.520
If swords aren’t your thing though, how&nbsp;
about a giant fire breathing dog? Well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:26.800
that is exactly what we get with Pluto from Black&nbsp;
Butler. And while he certainly isn’t generic,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:32.600
I don’t think he is extremely powerful&nbsp;
either, so he’s going in the Poof tier.

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:38.600
Now this leads us to probably the single&nbsp;
most Generic fire user in this ranking,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:42.120
which is Mikoto Suoh from the K anime. Yeah,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:45.600
that’s right. The show is literally just&nbsp;
called K. And he can basically use his aura&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:51.000
to create heat blasts and probably even help&nbsp;
him keep that sulky glare on his face 24/7.

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:56.800
Which is basically the same expression we&nbsp;
get from our seventh God Tier character,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:56.800 --> 00:16:01.520
Sasuke from Naruto. And as you can see we are&nbsp;
clearly ranking him above Madara, which may&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:07.560
trigger the Naruto fans here, but in my opinion,&nbsp;
he has such a master of his special Amaterasu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:07.560 --> 00:16:14.080
Flames, that he just had to be in God Tier. These&nbsp;
unique flames will only burn what Sasuke wants,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:19.760
but if he truly lets them loose, they won’t stop&nbsp;
burning until there is nothing left of his enemy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:19.760 --> 00:16:26.200
And while they didn’t really work on Madara,&nbsp;
they are super OP against basically anyone else.

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:32.640
This means if Sasuke is God Tier then his&nbsp;
brother Itachi must be… Dust Tier? Man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:38.160
the Naruto fan base is going to go insane. But&nbsp;
kinda using the same logic as with Sabo and Ace,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:42.120
both of the brothers' strongest flames&nbsp;
are Amaterasu, but since Sasuke uses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:47.080
them better than his brother, I just&nbsp;
have to rank Itachi one tier below.

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:50.440
ow if you’re feeling bad for&nbsp;
Itachi, maybe we should plop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:55.280
him down with Kirisaki in the Crazy Fire&nbsp;
Girlfriend tier to cheer him up. No? Okay,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:55.280 --> 00:17:00.600
well we do have another addition to this tier&nbsp;
and that is Kotori Itsuke from Date a Live,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:05.840
who is basically a fire spirit. But not just any&nbsp;
fire spirit because she can transform her arm&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:12.040
into a flaming ax or even an overpowered&nbsp;
flame cannon, because I mean why not…

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:17.480
And Megumin from Konosuba is another fire powered&nbsp;
girl, but she ends up in the Poof tier because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:17.480 --> 00:17:23.040
her fire spells quickly drain her Mana power which&nbsp;
leaves her relying on her allies most of the time.

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:26.640
And you'll never believe that&nbsp;
our next God Tier character was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:32.560
a contender for the strongest fire user&nbsp;
ever. This is Benimaru from Fire Force,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:37.840
whose Crimson Moon attack against this Fire&nbsp;
Demon literally took my breath away. I mean,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:43.880
wow, what a super impressive power for one&nbsp;
of the strongest fire users in the story.

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:48.240
Now we’ve only got two God Tiers&nbsp;
left to go. And I'll just warn you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:48.240 --> 00:17:51.320
they might be even stronger than Benimaru.

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:56.080
Before we get to those top dogs though,&nbsp;
we have Rin Okumura from Blue Exorcist,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:56.080 --> 00:18:00.920
who uses his supernatural blue fire and sword&nbsp;
skills to wipe out the royalty of the demon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:06.120
world. However, perhaps his most impressive feat&nbsp;
is that he created a fire attack powerful enough&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:10.920
to take out the Impure King demon all while&nbsp;
leaving his friends untouched by the magical&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:17.160
blue flames. Pretty impressive if you ask me,&nbsp;
which lands him a solid spot in the Dust Tier.

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:22.360
Yet another character with Blue flames that we&nbsp;
are putting in Dust Tier is Starjun from Toriko.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:27.320
This master chef and Gourmet Hunter can create&nbsp;
flames hot enough to melt Toriko’s iron silverware&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:32.520
attacks, and even produce giant flame slashes&nbsp;
that can create massive holes in the earth.

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:35.600
While Rin and Starjun’s blue&nbsp;
flames are awesome to look at,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:35.600 --> 00:18:40.920
this next character’s fire is some of the&nbsp;
prettiest in all of anime. This is Julis&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:47.440
Riessfeld from Asterisk War who summons fire with&nbsp;
the imagery of flowers. Quite nice if you ask me,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:52.360
but good looks only get you so far in this&nbsp;
ranking, so down in Poof tier she goes.

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:58.280
Which brings us to Tasuki from the anime Fushigi&nbsp;
Yuugi, who is honestly a pretty powerful fighter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:04.400
except that all of his fire power comes from his&nbsp;
magical Tessen fan. Barely Counts tier for him.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:08.360
Now if you want yet another OG&nbsp;
anime that will blow your mind,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:12.160
then check out Recca Hanabishi from&nbsp;
the Flame of Recca. And Recca fully&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:16.520
earns his place in the Dust tier because he&nbsp;
can summon fire at will, with his strongest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:21.440
attacks using the power of seven mythical&nbsp;
fire dragons to demolish his enemies.

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:27.440
However, you cannot talk about classic anime&nbsp;
without mentioning Jojo’s Bizarre Adventure, which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:34.240
of course has its very own fire user, Mohammed&nbsp;
Avdol, whose Stand power is called Magician Red,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:40.280
which fights with fire . And I honestly had a&nbsp;
bit of trouble ranking him. He’s certainly not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:46.160
Dust level, but I think he would wipe out all of&nbsp;
Poof tier, so even though it hurts my very soul&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:52.800
to call anyone from Jojo’s generic, I’m going&nbsp;
to drop him into the Generic Overpowered Tier.

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:57.760
Which is a better spot than Stella Vermillion from&nbsp;
Chivalry of a Failed Knight earned, because her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:57.760 --> 00:20:03.200
fiery sword skills are not all that impressive,&nbsp;
especially because it took her basically the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:09.960
whole anime to figure out that she had dragon&nbsp;
powers. That's a Poof tier if I’ve ever seen one.

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:14.600
Though if you want a character who is a master of&nbsp;
his powers right from the very start of the show,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:19.720
you should check out Stiyl Magnus from A&nbsp;
Certain Magical Index. This Generic tier&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:24.560
chain smoking pyromancer can summon fire with&nbsp;
his magical runes and spells, and if he needs to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:24.560 --> 00:20:29.720
bust out a strong attack he can create a fiery&nbsp;
monster to help fight against his opponents.

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:34.920
But he’s not actually a good guy, which&nbsp;
can also be said about Endeavor from My&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:41.200
Hero Academia as well because of the way&nbsp;
he seriously traumatized his kids. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:47.280
Endeavor is certainly an absolute powerhouse&nbsp;
of a fighter, whose Prominence Burn attack&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:52.160
can vaporize opponents in an instant.&nbsp;
Which earns him a place in Dust Tier.

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:56.200
If you want the perfect person to beat some&nbsp;
responsibility into Endeavor, look no further&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:56.200 --> 00:21:01.520
than Mereoleoona Vermillion from Black Clover.&nbsp;
This noblewoman magician is the captain of a Royal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:06.800
Knight squad and fights with giant explosive fire&nbsp;
blasts which makes her the strongest fire user&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:12.400
in the story and she can certainly compete with&nbsp;
nearly everyone else on this list. And she nearly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:12.400 --> 00:21:20.360
made it into God Tier, but couldn’t quite crack&nbsp;
my top ten, so she’ll have to stay in Dust Tier.

00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:27.000
However, the next character to ascend to&nbsp;
Godhood is Natsu from Fairy Tail. Because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:31.920
even though he can get stomped on by other&nbsp;
elements, there are almost no fire users as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:36.760
strong as this fire eating monster of a&nbsp;
character, whose flames are so powerful&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:42.480
that he can melt stone just by walking&nbsp;
past and even take out monstrous dragons.

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:46.640
Which leaves only one more God Tier character&nbsp;
left, and if you’ve been wondering all this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:46.640 --> 00:21:51.720
time if I was going to leave Shinra off another&nbsp;
list, well then this one's for you. Because the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:51.720 --> 00:21:56.920
main character of Fire Force has gotten so&nbsp;
strong that his fire can even allow him to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:56.920 --> 00:22:03.360
zip around at light speed and destroy opponents&nbsp;
with truly massive explosions. And those are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:03.360 --> 00:22:07.440
just a few of the god-like abilities&nbsp;
that he unlocks later on in the manga.

00:22:07.440 --> 00:22:12.440
But sadly we cannot end on the fiery godliness&nbsp;
of Shirna because we have one more character to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:12.440 --> 00:22:17.680
go. And that is the Flame Hashira Rengoku&nbsp;
from Demon Slayer. Now this may come as a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:17.680 --> 00:22:23.840
shock to some of you but Rengoku is actually&nbsp;
not a fire user. While there was some debate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:29.200
about the incredible fire powers that we&nbsp;
see in the anime, these flames are not real,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:33.280
they are just a visualization of&nbsp;
the sword skills. But they do look&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:33.280 --> 00:22:39.200
so cool so we’ll throw him in with the Levy in&nbsp;
the Technically Not Fire But Still Fire tier.

00:22:39.200 --> 00:22:44.000
Buuuttt, while the Hashira’s elemental powers&nbsp;
are fake, the demons’ magical abilities in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:49.400
show are very much real. So can you imagine&nbsp;
if Rengoku was a demon and had actual fire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:49.400 --> 00:22:56.200
powers? Surely he would become one of&nbsp;
the strongest demons alive, right? Well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:56.200 --> 00:23:00.920
if you want to find out how that would go,&nbsp;
you can check out this video right here.

00:23:00.920 --> 00:23:03.360
Thanks for watching, and&nbsp;
I’ll see you in the next one.

